# One git patch filename per line, applied in order to .runtime/robocasa (robosuite is
# exported to its robosuite/ subdirectory). Ported from RoboEnv:
# 0001 loads rewritten object MJCF from a private temporary file, so the shared asset
#      cache is never written; RoboEnv's helper is inlined so upstream imports nothing new.
# 0002 removes duplicate counter geoms in first-seen order, so a seed rebuilds one kitchen.
# 0003 checks MUJOCO_EGL_DEVICE_ID against index CUDA masks only, not GPU UUIDs.
0001-private-object-xml.patch
0002-deterministic-counter-regions.patch
0003-robosuite-egl-device-check.patch
